+## Find saved generation and recheck reports
+
+```sh
+python -B -m testpilot history --root eval/results
+python -B -m testpilot history --root saved-runs --max-depth 3 --status failed --json
+```
+
+The finder reads bounded native `report.json` and `recheck.json` files, showing
+literal targets, retained test paths, recorded outcomes and report hashes without
+running tests or a model. Filters select rows; malformed neighbors remain visible
+as problems. Exit 0 means a complete selected scan, exit 1 prints partial results,
+and exit 2 means invalid input or failed output. Paths are not chronology. See
+[saved-run history](docs/HISTORY.md) for literal query filters, depth, work limits
+and the Python API.
+
